ShallowFrontier

This repository contains ShallowFrontier-specific research code and
reproducibility artifacts for energy-efficient LLM training-data selection.

ShallowFrontier builds on the InstructDiff framework:

  InstructDiff: Domain-Adaptive Data Selection via Differential Entropy
  for Efficient LLM Fine-Tuning

Official upstream repository:
  https://github.com/zhuchichi56/Instruct-diff

Original InstructDiff authors retain attribution for upstream framework
and evaluation components incorporated or adapted in this repository.

The Math evaluation code under eval/math_evaluation retains its own
upstream license notice in that directory.

ShallowFrontier-specific contributions include prefix-limited candidate
scoring, asymmetric prefix extrapolation, matched selection-stage cost
measurement, GPU energy analysis, and the K128/K256 experiments.

This NOTICE is an attribution record and does not replace licenses
applicable to individual upstream components.
